                    'title'           => 'About Us',
                    'slug'            => 'about-us',
                    'description'     => "<p>At FoodNanny, we believe food is more than just a meal — it’s an experience. That’s why we built a smart, reliable, and user-friendly multivendor food delivery platform that brings your favorite local restaurants right to your doorstep.</p><p><br></p><p>Whether you're craving street food, home-cooked meals, or gourmet bites, FoodNanny connects you with the best eateries in town — all in one place.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h2>What We Do</h2><p><br></p><p>We partner with diverse restaurants, cloud and home chefs to offer a wide variety of food options through our app and website. Customers can browse menus, place orders, track deliveries, and enjoy meals from the comfort of their homes.</p><p><br></p><p>Our platform supports:</p><ul><li>Real-time delivery tracking</li><li>Easy-to-use ordering experience</li><li>Secure online &amp; offline payments</li><li>Location-based restaurant suggestions</li><li>Ratings &amp; reviews to help you choose better</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><h2>For Restaurants &amp; Vendors</h2><p><br></p><p>FoodNanny is built to empower local food businesses. With our multivendor system, vendors get a full dashboard to manage menus, orders, promotions, and earnings — all in one place. We’re here to help you grow faster and reach more hungry customers every day.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h2>For Delivery Heroes</h2><p><br></p><p>We work with a growing fleet of delivery partners who ensure every meal arrives hot and on time. With smart route optimization and fair payouts, we make delivery efficient and rewarding.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h2>Join the FoodNanny Family</h2><p><br></p><p>Whether you’re a food lover, vendor, or delivery rider — FoodNanny welcomes you. We’re more than just a platform — we’re your neighborhood food companion.</p><p><br></p>",
