ated to the foodnanny Services from time to time. Uber will provide you with at least 07 days’ notice in the event of a material change to any foodnanny Terms, policies or supplemental terms that detrimentally affects your rights under these foodnanny Terms. Amendments will be effective upon posting of such updated foodnanny Terms at this location or the amended supplemental terms or policies on the applicable foodnanny Service or at this location (as the case may be). Your continued access or use of the foodnanny Services after such posting, or after the expiry of the notice period (whichever is later), constitutes your consent to be bound by the foodnanny Terms, policies and supplemental terms, as amended.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>1.3. Termination or restriction of the foodnanny Services</strong></p><p>(a) foodnanny may restrict you from accessing or using the foodnanny Services, or any part of them, immediately, without notice, in circumstances where foodnanny reasonably suspects that:</p><p>(i) you have, or are likely to, breach these foodnanny Terms; and/or</p><p><br></p><p>(ii) you do not, or are likely not to, qualify, under applicable law or the standards and policies of foodnanny, to access and use the foodnanny Services.</p><p><br></p><p>(b) foodnanny may terminate these foodnanny Terms or any foodnanny Services with respect to you, or generally cease offering or deny access to the foodnanny Services or any portion thereof:</p><p><br></p><p>(i) immediately, where foodnanny reasonably suspects that: (i) you have, or are likely to, materially breach these foodnanny Terms; and/or (ii) you do not, or are likely not to, qualify, under applicable law or the standards and policies of foodnanny, to access and use the foodnanny Services; or</p><p><br></p><p>(ii) on 07 days’ written notice to you, where foodnanny, acting reasonably, terminates these foodnanny Terms or any foodnanny Services for any legitimate business, legal or regulatory reason.</p><p><br></p><p>(c) Without limiting its other rights under these foodnanny Terms, Uber may immediately restrict or deactivate your access to the foodnanny Services if you breach the Community Guidelines at any time.</p><p><br></p><p>(d) You may terminate these foodnanny Terms, or stop using the foodnanny Services, at any time, for any reason.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>1.4. Privacy</strong></p><p>Our collection and use of personal information in connection with the foodnanny Services is as provided in Uber’s privacy notice located at https://www.foodnanny.com/legal. foodnanny may provide to a claims processor or an insurer any necessary information (including your contact information) if there is a complaint, dispute or conflict, which may include an accident, involving you and a Third Party Provider (including a transportation network company driver) and such information or data is necessary to resolve the complaint, dispute or conflict.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>2. THE foodnanny SERVICES</strong></p><p>foodnanny will provide the foodnanny Services to you in accordance with these foodnanny Terms. The foodnanny Services constitute the provision of a technology platform that enables you, as a user of foodnanny’s applications or websites (each, an “Application”) to: (a) arrange and schedule certain services with independent third party providers of those services that have an agreement with foodnanny or its affiliates (“Third Party Providers”), which includes transportation services from those Third Party Providers; and (b) facilitate payments to Third Party Providers for the services provided to you by those parties and receive receipts from an foodnanny affiliate for those payments.</p><p><br></p><p>The foodnanny Services are made available solely for your personal, non-commercial use, unless foodnanny has agreed with you otherwise in a separate agreement. You acknowledge that: (a) foodnanny does not provide transportation services or function as a transportation carrier; (b) all such transportation services are provided by independent third party contractors who are not employed by foodnanny or any of its affiliates. foodnanny accepts liability for the foodnanny Services and Application that it provides to you subject to these foodnanny Terms. Third Party Providers are solely responsible for the services they provide to you.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Licence</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Subject to your compliance with these foodnanny Terms, foodnanny grants you a limited, non-exclusive, non-sublicensable, revocable, non-transferable licence to: (i) access and use the Applications on your personal device solely in connection with your use of the foodnanny Services; and (ii) access and use any content, information and related materials that may be made available through the foodnanny Services, in each case solely for your personal, non-commercial use. Any rights not expressly granted herein are reserved by foodnanny and foodnanny’s licensors.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Restrictions</strong></p><p>You may not: (i) remove any copyright, trade mark or other proprietary notices from any portion of the foodnanny Services; (ii) reproduce, modify, prepare derivative works based upon, distribute, license, lease, sell, resell, transfer, publicly display, publicly perform, transmit, stream, broadcast or otherwise exploit the foodnanny Services except as expressly permitted by foodnanny; (iii) decompile, reverse engineer or disassemble the foodnanny Services except as may be permitted by applicable law; (iv) link to, mirror or frame any portion of the foodnanny Services; (v) cause or launch any programs or scripts for the purpose of scraping, indexing, surveying, or otherwise data mining any portion of the foodnanny Services or unduly burdening or hindering the operation and/or functionality of any aspect of the foodnanny Services; or (vi) attempt to gain unauthorised access to or impair any aspect of the foodnanny Services or its related systems or networks.</p><p><br></p><p>You also acknowledge that the foodnanny Services may be made available under such brands or request options by or in connection with: (i) certain of foodnanny’s subsidiaries and affiliates; or (ii) independent Third Party Providers, including transportation network company drivers, transportation charter permit holders or holders of similar transportation permits, authorisations or licences.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Third Party Services and Content</strong></p><p>The foodnanny Services may be made available or accessed in connection with third party services and content (including advertising) that foodnanny does not control. You acknowledge that different terms of use and privacy policies may apply to your use of such third party services and content. foodnanny does not endorse such third party services and content and in no event shall foodnanny be responsible or liable for any products or services of such Third Party Providers. Additionally, Apple Inc., Google, Inc., Microsoft Corporation or BlackBerry Limited and/or their applicable international subsidiaries and affiliates will be third-party beneficiaries to this contract if you access the Services using Applications developed for Apple iOS, Android, Microsoft Windows, or Blackberry-powered mobile devices, respectively. These third party beneficiaries are not parties to this contract and are not responsible for the provision or support of Uber Services in any manner. Your access to the Uber Services using these devices is subject to terms set forth in the applicable third party beneficiary’s terms of service.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ownership</strong></p><p>The foodnanny Services and all rights therein are and shall remain foodnanny’s property or the property of foodnanny’s licensors. Neither these foodnanny Terms nor your use of the foodnanny Services convey or grant to you any rights: (i) in or related to the foodnanny Services except for the limited licence granted above; or (ii) to use or reference in any manner foodnanny’s company names, logos, product and service names, trademarks or services marks or those of foodnanny’s licensors.</p>',
